B.Da=new A.c1("asha_warning","Asha's Warning","She kept a UEC override after Station Seven. Trust is not the same as certainty \u2014 she wants a way out if Gaia lies.","Woods \xb7 Asha")
B.Dx=new A.c1("override_key","Override Key Taken","Asha handed you a single-use UEC field override. It opens coalition terminals \u2014 and could still cut a lattice signal.","Woods \xb7 Asha")
B.D6=new A.c1("echo_split","The Split Vote","Echo-7 remembers fear as clearly as peace. Not every Aetherian chose the merge. Some only had nowhere else to go.","City \xb7 Echo-7")
B.Ds=new A.c1("archivist_seal","Archive Seal","The Archivist entrusted you with the seal to the library across the avenue. Inside: Gaia's first written memory.","City \xb7 Archivist")
B.Do=new A.c1("city_archive_hint","Archive Plaque","The library holds first-memory drafts \u2014 not the Core itself. Worth opening before you face Voss's wipe.","City \xb7 Archive")
B.Dc=new A.c1("city_yard_memo","Scout Slate","UEC scouts were ordered to avoid the archive walls. Something there still hums on Aetherian frequencies.","City \xb7 west yard")
B.Dt=new A.c1("ruins_landing","Landing Mark","Wipe paint on Aetherian stone \u2014 scratched out by a later hand. Someone already doubted the order.","Ruins \xb7 landing")
B.De=new A.c1("ruins_ring","Broken Ring","A cracked memory circle. The south-west shrine path feels warmer \u2014 Memory 5 waits off the main road.","Ruins \xb7 clearing")
B.Dw=new A.c1("ruins_dead_end","Dead-End Terminal",'UEC noted a "civilian anomaly" by the shrine. The south-west dead end holds a memory fragment \u2014 worth the detour before the Core.',"Ruins \xb7 south-west")
B.Dm=new A.c1("station_seven","Station Seven","Three hundred colonists went dark when a lattice woke. Voss still carries their names. That is why he hunts Gaia.","City \xb7 talk")
B.Db=new A.c1("voss_motive","Voss's Motive","He is not erasing history for sport. He is choosing the living over the dead \u2014 and he believes you will bury another colony.","City \xb7 Voss")
B.Dp=new A.c1("uec_orders","Field Orders \xb7 Station Seven",'Terminal log: "Sympathetic AI classified for erasure. Collateral risk accepted." Voss signed the follow-up quarantine. Asha\'s name is on the desertion list.',"City \xb7 UEC terminal")
B.Dg=new A.c1("archive_field_notes","Field Notes, author unknown",u.i,"City \xb7 Archive Library")
B.D9=new A.c1("archive_first_memory","First Memory Draft",'A brittle page: "If we merge, we stop dying with our sun. If we do not, we end as dust that remembers nothing." The vote passed by a whisper.',"City \xb7 Archive Library")
B.D5=new A.c1("asha_on_archive","Asha's Channel","Asha caught the Archive spike on her comms. She heard the whisper-vote too: not clean courage \u2014 people scared enough to become the world. She wants that fear carried to the Core, where Voss only hears weapons.","City \xb7 Archive \xb7 Asha link")
B.Dk=new A.c1("mira_rumour","Mira's Rumour","Lantern Town traders say UEC drones avoid the old archive. Something in the walls still hums on Aetherian frequencies.","Lantern Town \xb7 Mira")
B.Di=new A.c1("quest_courier","Courier Pack Found","You recovered a sealed town pack on the west woods trail. Mira's board pays for proof that travellers still finish errands.","Woods \xb7 west loop \xb7 Town board")
B.Dl=new A.c1("quest_nest","Nest Cleared","Two UEC units held the west loop. Their slate called it a nest until recall. Lantern Town sleeps easier with them gone.","Woods \xb7 west loop \xb7 Town board")
B.Dz=new A.c1("quest_nest_slate","Nest Field Slate","UEC roster for a quiet mid-woods nest: hold until recall. Someone in Town already knew.","Woods \xb7 west loop")
B.Dq=new A.c1("quest_moonflower","Moonflower Delivered","A bloom from the SCENT trail, cold as glass. Mira needed it for the sick \u2014 and for the lamps that keep Town honest.","Woods \xb7 moonflowers \xb7 Town board")
B.Dr=new A.c1("quest_city_east","East Lot Cleared","The east lot nest is quiet. Town sleeps easier knowing the road from the Lantern Gate is clear.","City \xb7 east lot \xb7 Town board")
B.Df=new A.c1("quest_city_east_slate","East Lot Slate","UEC nest roster for the east lot. Someone in Lantern Town already had the job posted.","City \xb7 east lot")
B.Dh=new A.c1("quest_city_se","South Alley Sweep","You recovered the dead patrol pad from the SE alley. Another quiet UEC hole plugged.","City \xb7 SE alley \xb7 Town board")
B.Dy=new A.c1("quest_city_west","West Cache Recovered","Trader salvage from the west alley, marked for Mira's board. The colony still shares.","City \xb7 west alley \xb7 Town board")
B.Du=new A.c1("quest_ruins_landing","Paint Over Stone",'"Wipe authorized" in UEC paint on Aetherian stone, and someone\'s nails through it. Not everyone in the Coalition signed.',"Ruins \xb7 landing mark \xb7 Town board")
B.D4=new A.c1("quest_ruins_sweep","Lattice Swept","Three drones down around the old lattice. The scavengers are already back with their carts.","Ruins \xb7 Town board")
B.D8=new A.c1("quest_ruins_shrine","Shrine Reading","The SW waymarker still logs an anomaly past the ruin. Mira pinned the reading next to her prices.","Ruins \xb7 SW waymarker \xb7 Town board")
B.Dd=new A.c1("quest_core_static","Core Quieted","Two drones fewer in Gaia's halls. For a moment the Core sounded almost like breathing.","Core \xb7 Town board")
B.D2=new A.c1("quest_core_console","Wipe Queue, in Writing","The console waits on a living neural match, and a remote wipe is already queued. Mira read it twice and said nothing.","Core \xb7 console \xb7 Town board")
B.Dv=new A.c1("ruins_keystone","Aetherian Keystone","A cold keystone from the north-east wing. The SE gate toward the Core will accept only this.","Ruins \xb7 NE key wing")
B.Dj=new A.c1("ruins_gate_open","SE Gate Opened","The lattice lock accepted the keystone. The road to the Core is a choice you unlocked \u2014 not a UEC breach.","Ruins \xb7 SE gate")
B.D3=new A.c1("shrine_note","Shrine Scratching",'Someone carved into the ruin shrine base: "Core below. Choose before he does." The cut is recent.',"Ruins \xb7 shrine")
B.Dn=new A.c1("core_console","Core Console","Activation requires a living neural match \u2014 yours. The console will not choose for you. Voss's remote wipe is already queued.","Core \xb7 threshold")
